English:
definition nhdsWithin
  signature: (x : X) (s : Set X)
  body: 𝓝 x ⊓ 𝓟 s

@[inherit_doc]
scoped[Topology] notation "𝓝[" s "] " x:100 => nhdsWithin x s

中文:
