/-- A function between topological spaces is continuous at a point `x₀`
if `f x` tends to `f x₀` when `x` tends to `x₀`. -/
@[fun_prop]
/--
Definition of `ContinuousAt` / `ContinuousAt` 的定义

English:
definition ContinuousAt
  signature: (f : X -> Y) (x : X)
  body: Tendsto f (𝓝 x) (𝓝 (f x))

中文:
定义 ContinuousAt
  签名: (f : X -> Y) (x : X)
